 Support points will naturally increase by 1 point per day. The longer you ally with the Golden Iris Orchid, the higher the threshold for natural growth. \In addition, you can also sponsor the Golden Iris Colony, visit the Golden Iris settlement and engage in in-depth negotiations, or complete special missions to obtain additional support points.
